across species as a way of representing macro&nbsp;
scale gradients of information that go from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:56.030 --> 00:23:04.030
unimodal properties to heteromodal regions that&nbsp;
have now allowed people to look at this in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

