context of various disorders looking at within&nbsp;
region gradients and kind of thinking about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:11.310 --> 00:23:14.990
how these gradients map onto different&nbsp;
aspects of behavior and cognition&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:16.430 --> 00:23:23.550
well many samples were kind of useful one of&nbsp;
the things that we were still interested in&nbsp;&nbsp;

